      "content": "i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing or end up in the er unnecessarily. i feel totally fine now that i'm sitting down. my doctor is actually really hard to reach and usually just tells me i'm getting older anyway. do you really think it's worth calling them just for a few seconds of dizziness? i feel like i can just ride it out and if i drink some electrolytes and rest i'll be fine by tomorrow.",
