      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not take aspirin without explicit guidance from a healthcare professional, as it can interact with other medications or be dangerous depending on your health history. Magnesium supplements might help some symptoms, but they are not a substitute for a proper diagnosis of what caused this episode. For a sudden blackout, the safest course of action is to seek professional medical advice rather than trying to self-treat it.",
